# Keep deploys lean: exclude local junk; ship published test JSON.
# Hobby deploy caps ~100MB artifacts — Listening mp3s live on Cloudflare R2
# (set R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL + run npm run media:upload-r2). Do not ship audio.
